      "text": "[5:46AM] #AgegeMotorRd\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nIt's unobstructed movement from Iyana dopemu underneath bridge inward Cement en route Mongoro down to Ile-zik. \n\nIt's getting busy at Ile-zik intersection as a result of traffic light alternation and early morning influx of Vehicular flow.\nFurther movement after National down Bolade intersection is encouraging.\n\nReturn Trip back to Dopemu underneath the bridge is good to go at this moment from Bolade intersection.\nDrive carefully!\n#FollowLASTMA\n@trafficpalava \n@TrafficChiefNG \n@lagostraffic961",
